# Needs the dev test stock (TST). UI only: no days advanced, no trades.
name hovering a Stock Monitor sparkline or the detail chart shows a crosshair and that day's price
monitor remember
monitor close
monitor open
hover FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorSpark-TST 0.99 0.5
expect-text FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorHoverTip TST · today · ₡
hover FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorRow-TST 0.03 0.5
expect-hidden FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorHoverTip
click FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorRow-TST
wait 1
hover FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorDetailChart 1 0.5
expect-text FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorHoverTip TST · today · ₡
expect-visible FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorHoverLine
hover FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorDetailChart 0 0.5
expect-text FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorHoverTip TST · 29 days ago
expect-no-overflow FinanceOverhaulStockMonitor
capture stock-monitor-hover
click FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorRange-7
wait 1
hover FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorDetailChart 0 0.5
expect-text FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorHoverTip TST · 6 days ago
cleanup:
hover off
click FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorRange-30
monitor close
monitor restore
